     "Coat",
     "Toss the chicken with the cornstarch, baking powder, salt, pepper and garlic powder until evenly coated."
    ],
    [
     "Bake",
     "Spread on lined sheet pans and bake at 425°F (220°C) for 20–25 minutes, flipping halfway, until crisp at the edges."
    ],
    [
